      "PlayerResponse": {
        "description": "`POST /api/v1/players` 的回應。\n\n`account_id` 是對外契約，對應 DB 的 `auth_provider_id`（0003 改的名）。\nclient 的 `PlayerDto` 用 `[JsonProperty(\"account_id\")]` 寫死了這個 key。\n\n綁定流程做起來的時候，這裡應該一併把 `auth_provider` 也吐出去——\n只有「provider 那邊的 id」而不知道是哪一家 provider，資訊是不完整的。\n那一次改動要連 client 一起發版。",
        "properties": {
          "account_id": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Account Id"
          },
          "created_at": {
            "format": "date-time",
            "title": "Created At",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "device_id": {
            "title": "Device Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "player_id": {
            "format": "uuid",
            "title": "Player Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "session_token": {
            "title": "Session Token",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "player_id",
          "device_id",
          "account_id",
          "created_at",
          "session_token"
        ],
        "title": "PlayerResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
