      "SpiritResponse": {
        "description": "`GET /api/v1/spirits/{placeId}` 的回應。\n\n**欄位名是對外契約，跟資料庫欄位名脫鉤。** 0002 把 DB 欄位改成\n`spirit_id` / `display_name` / `*_radius_meters` 之後，這裡靠\n`validation_alias` 從 ORM 物件讀新名字，但輸出仍是舊的 JSON key——\nUnity client 的 `SpiritDto` 用 `[JsonProperty(\"place_id\")]` 寫死了那些\n名字，改動等於要發一版客戶端。\n\n改 DB 欄位名不需要動客戶端，這正是兩者脫鉤的用途；反過來說，**要改這裡的\n欄位名時，必須連同 client 一起改**。",
        "properties": {
          "is_active": {
            "title": "Is Active",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "latitude": {
            "title": "Latitude",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "longitude": {
            "title": "Longitude",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "name": {
            "title": "Name",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "orientation": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SpiritOrientationResponse"
          },
          "place_id": {
            "title": "Place Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "sense_radius_m": {
            "title": "Sense Radius M",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "summon_radius_m": {
            "title": "Summon Radius M",
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "place_id",
          "name",
          "latitude",
          "longitude",
          "summon_radius_m",
          "sense_radius_m",
          "is_active"
        ],
        "title": "SpiritResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
